    "created_at": "2023-04-14T16:59:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-04-14T16:59:29Z",
    "body": "I agree that the spec is broken for this case. The difference between the spec and at least the Chromium implementation is that the [spec for **remove**](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-remove) runs the [removing steps](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-remove-ext) at step 15, but removes the node from the tree before that, at step 11. The Chromium impl [runs that call to HidePopoverInternal](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/refs/heads/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/html_element.cc;l=2530;drc=11ff9071e6112d0b830036e7c5bc2b00560649c0) before the node is removed from the tree. \r\n\r\nI'm not sure what the best way to fix the spec is. Seems like there might need to be \"before removing steps\" added before step 11 or something? @josepharhar @annevk @nt1m ",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
